direction: right
Client: Client {shape: person}
API: Workflow API {shape: rectangle}
Orchestrator: Durable saga orchestrator {shape: hexagon}
State: Saga state store {shape: cylinder}
Timers: Durable timer queue {shape: queue}
ParticipantA: Participant A {shape: rectangle}
ParticipantB: Participant B {shape: rectangle}
Retries: Retry queue {shape: queue}
DeadLetters: Dead-letter queue {shape: queue}
Operator: Operations console {shape: page}
Client -> API: start workflow
API -> Orchestrator
Orchestrator -> State: checkpoint step
Orchestrator -> ParticipantA: command with idempotency key
ParticipantA -> Orchestrator: success
Orchestrator -> Timers: schedule deadline
Orchestrator -> ParticipantB: command with idempotency key
ParticipantB -> Orchestrator: success or failure
Timers -> Orchestrator: deadline expired
Orchestrator -> Retries: retry with backoff
Retries -> Orchestrator
Orchestrator -> ParticipantA: compensate
Orchestrator -> State: mark compensated
Orchestrator -> DeadLetters: retries exhausted
DeadLetters -> Operator: manual review
Operator -> Orchestrator: resume or abort
